{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>And he weakened.</b> He cast the lot upon him, and it has three names: Pur, Goral, Chalash. Another explanation: Therefore it is written ויחלש and it did not write ויכה, because Amalek was a diviner by the stars and selected for himself men who were not destined to die in that war. And Joshua did likewise, as it is written ״בחר לנו אנשים״ — which implies men who are hardy and strong; therefore Joshua could not kill them but cut off their hands and feet, and this is ויחלש."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:03:20.050888715Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}